; ==== the carry out of byte 7 is the final carry  and it is dropped ====
  [-]
; ASSERT ptr=16
; the addend has been consumed and every scratch cell is back at nought;
; a{8} is NOT clear  because a{8} is the answer;
; ASSERT zero 8:27

; emit
; the sum  eight bytes little endian
L16
  .>.>.>.>.>.>.>.
